diff --git a/NOTES.md b/NOTES.md
index 3359768..ee28697 100644
--- a/NOTES.md
+++ b/NOTES.md
@@ -13,3 +13,8 @@
 - Mounds: circle r=0.177 vs mound box (half 0.25).
 - Walls (arena edge, middle wall): |x|,|y| <= 2.2729; rover0 x>=0.2271, rover1 x<=-0.2271. No gaps.
 - Lander: safe rule keep rover centre x>=-1.205 or y>=-1.465.
+## Send/sample/termination (probed)
+- Send: 2D dist rover-center to lander center <= 4.0, middle wall does NOT block. Pillars & other rover block. Heading quirk: facing away from lander can bypass occluders. One send transfers everything held. Works with full store.
+- Sample: dist < 0.25 (0.245 ok). Sample object persists; can resample after drop. Drop empties store.
+- Move happens first, then operator evaluated at new position.
+- Terminated when goal true (needs stores empty). No env truncation. at_home: dist<0.25 from start & |dtheta|<~0.4 (aim <0.35).
